<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .header-title {
    font-size: 24pt;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .subtitle {
    font-size: 16pt;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .section-heading {
    font-size: 18pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  ul {
    list-style-type: disc;
    padding-left: 25px;
    margin-top: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  li {
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .divider {
    text-align: center;
    margin: 20px 0;
    font-size: 12pt;
  }
  .highlight-text {
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #cc0000; /* Simulating the red color */
  }
  .table-container {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  .table-container td {
    padding: 8px 0;
  }
  .logo-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  .logo-grid > div {
    flex: 1 1 150px; /* Adjust based on desired layout */
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-title">SVKM's NMIMS</div>
  <div class="subtitle">
    <span data-field="institution.name_1">{{ institution.name_1 }}</span><br>
    <span data-field="institution.name_2">{{ institution.name_2 }}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="divider">---</div>
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">
    <span data-field="document_title">{{ document_title }}</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-heading">About Corporate Relations</div>
  <ul>
    <li>Inplant Training and Placement Team</li>
    <li>Headed by <span data-field="personnel.head_name">{{ personnel.head_name }}</span>, Chairman Corporate Relations & Placements</li>
    <li>Dedicated Team of Placement Executives</li>
    <li>Senior & Junior Students Placement Coordinators</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="section-heading" style="margin-top: 30px;">Major functions</div>
  <ul>
    <li>Industry Connect - MoU's</li>
    <li>Inplant training</li>
    <li>Placements</li>
    <li>Expert talks, Industry Competitions</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-heading">About Training & Placement Cell</div>
  <p>The placement cell acts as a facilitator for Technology Programs like <span data-field="program_types">{{ program_types }}</span>.</p>
  <p>Department focuses on building skills that makes the student industry ready. Regular interactive sessions by the Department officials, Industry experts, Alumni on regular basis</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Training and Testing Modules for Aptitude, Technical and Life skills</li>
    <li>CV Review</li>
    <li>Regular SWOT Analysis</li>
    <li>Mock Interviews</li>
    <li>Regular Counseling/ Career Guidance sessions</li>
    <li>Feedback shared with parents on regular basis</li>
    <li>Handholding of each student until he/she achieves the dream offer</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Strong industry connect ensured all the selected students of <span data-field="program_types">{{ program_types }}</span> obtain joining related information despite COVID -19 situation</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-heading">Placement achieved through strong Industry connect (2019-20)</div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p>&#9633; 130+ companies considered B.Tech students for Final Placements</p>
    <p>&#9633; Multiple Job offers for many B.Tech students</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="section-heading" style="font-size: 16pt;">International Offers</div>
    <p><span data-field="international_companies_count">{{ international_companies_count }}</span> International companies with packages up to <span data-field="international_package_value">{{ international_package_value }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="section-heading" style="font-size: 16pt;">Domestic Offers</div>
    <ul>
      <li>Highest Package : <span data-field="domestic_highest_package">{{ domestic_highest_package }}</span></li>
      <li>Average Package: <span data-field="domestic_average_package">{{ domestic_average_package }}</span></li>
    </ul>
    <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
      <p>&#9633; <span data-field="domestic_companies_count">{{ domestic_companies_count }}</span> Companies on Campus offering more than <span data-field="domestic_high_threshold">{{ domestic_high_threshold }}</span>.</p>
      <p>&#9633; <span data-field="domestic_placed_students_count">{{ domestic_placed_students_count }}</span> B.Tech students placed with Dream offers</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="section-heading" style="font-size: 16pt;">MCA</div>
    <ul>
      <li>&#9633; <span data-field="mca_companies_count">{{ mca_companies_count }}</span> companies considered MCA students for both Internship and Final Placements</li>
      <li>&#9633; Highest Package : <span data-field="mca_highest_package">{{ mca_highest_package }}</span></li>
      <li>&#9633; Average Package: <span data-field="mca_average_package">{{ mca_average_package }}</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

