<div class="page">
  <p>Recruitment from <span data-field="employer.name">{{ employer.name }}</span>, <span data-field="employer.name">{{ employer.name }}</span> placement cell since past 2 instances was very positive. The placement team is always reachable, prompt with the responses & interviews are scheduled seamlessly. Interaction with faculty helped in better awareness of the institute's offerings & infrastructure in detail. The students from <span data-field="employer.name">{{ employer.name }}</span>, <span data-field="employer.name">{{ employer.name }}</span> are clearly recognized from the rest of the candidates as they are all well groomed & confident during the interview which according to me is an unique and positive trait of <span data-field="employer.name">{{ employer.name }}</span></p>
  <div style="text-align: right; margin-top: 50px;">
